{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06335","headline":"汝坟秋同仙州王长史翰闻百舌鸟 · 祖咏","name":"汝坟秋同仙州王长史翰闻百舌鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋天闻好鸟，惊起出帘帷。\n却念殊方月，能鸣已後时。\n迁乔诚可早，出谷此何迟。\n顾影慙无对，怀羣空所思。\n凄凉岁欲晚，萧索燕将辞。\n留听未终曲，弥令心独悲。\n高飞凭力致，巧啭任天姿。\n返覆知而静，间关断若遗。\n花繁上林路，霜落汝川湄。\n且长凌风翮，乘春自有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}